2026-05-24 fix-visible-ship-regression-v2

Symptom:
RCS effects visible, imported Blender Scout ship mesh effectively missing in Game View.

Root cause:
ImportedDemoScoutVisual was instantiated by PrototypeFunctionalShipBinder with localScale=(1,1,1).
FBX mesh bounds at that scale were tiny. Example runtime MeshRenderer bounds for DEMO_Scout_Mk1_GEO_Hull_Core_Faceted were approximately (0.014, 0.010, 0.020) Unity units.

Fix:
PrototypeFunctionalShipBinder now scales the visible FBX instance to 100 while keeping FunctionalSocketRig and functional sockets at scale 1.

